Notebook[{
  Cell["Revestimiento circular enterrado", "Title"],
  Cell["Hoja de cálculo para un escenario determinístico", "Subtitle"],

  Cell["Objeto y alcance", "Section"],
  Cell["Este cuaderno calcula las acciones perimetrales, las resultantes seccionales y la demanda elástica de tensión normal circunferencial de una sección corrugada CSPI de referencia. La coordenada angular θ vale cero en la clave y aumenta en sentido horario. Todas las resultantes se expresan por metro de longitud del conducto.", "Text"],
  Cell["El cálculo corresponde a un único estado biaxial uniforme prescrito. No calcula resistencia, utilización, factor de seguridad, capacidad de juntas o pernos, corrosión ni una alternativa de hormigón proyectado. Qθ se conserva como resultante seccional y no se transforma en una tensión cortante local.", "Text"],
  Cell["Uso: abrir el archivo en Wolfram y seleccionar Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. El cuaderno es autocontenido y no requiere R, archivos de datos ni conexión a internet.", "Text"],

  Cell["1. Convenciones y ecuaciones de equilibrio", "Section"],
  Cell["Pr es positiva hacia el exterior y Pt es positiva en el sentido creciente de θ. Nθ es positiva a tracción. Los signos de Mθ y Qθ quedan definidos por las ecuaciones de equilibrio siguientes.", "Text"],
  Cell["dNθ/dθ - Qθ + R Pt = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["dQθ/dθ + Nθ - R Pr = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["dMθ/dθ - R Qθ = 0", "Equation"],
  Cell["El multiplicador 0 ≤ α ≤ 1 escala exclusivamente la componente tangencial prescrita. Los casos α = 0 y α = 1 representan, respectivamente, su omisión y su incorporación completa; α no es un coeficiente de fricción.", "Text"],

  Cell["2. Entradas del escenario", "Section"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[\"Global`*\"];
Inputs = <|
  \"insideDiameterM\" -> 2.63,
  \"effectiveVerticalStressKPa\" -> 100.,
  \"k0\" -> 0.50,
  \"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\" -> 0.,
  \"alphaValues\" -> {1., 0.},
  \"youngModulusGPa\" -> 200.,
  \"nominalProfileMm\" -> \"76 x 25\",
  \"specifiedThicknessMm\" -> 2.80,
  \"designBaseThicknessMm\" -> 2.64,
  \"areaMm2PerMm\" -> 3.281,
  \"inertiaMm4PerMm\" -> 249.73,
  \"sectionModulusMm3PerMm\" -> 17.81
|>;
InputRows = {
  {\"D_i\", Inputs[\"insideDiameterM\"], \"m\"},
  {\"sigma'_v\", Inputs[\"effectiveVerticalStressKPa\"], \"kPa\"},
  {\"K_0\", Inputs[\"k0\"], \"-\"},
  {\"Delta u\", Inputs[\"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\"], \"kPa\"},
  {\"alpha\", Row[Inputs[\"alphaValues\"], \", \"], \"-\"},
  {\"E_theta\", Inputs[\"youngModulusGPa\"], \"GPa\"},
  {\"perfil\", Inputs[\"nominalProfileMm\"], \"mm\"},
  {\"t_s\", Inputs[\"specifiedThicknessMm\"], \"mm\"},
  {\"t_d\", Inputs[\"designBaseThicknessMm\"], \"mm\"},
  {\"A_p\", Inputs[\"areaMm2PerMm\"], \"mm^2/mm\"},
  {\"I_p\", Inputs[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"], \"mm^4/mm\"},
  {\"S_p\", Inputs[\"sectionModulusMm3PerMm\"], \"mm^3/mm\"}
};
Grid[
  Prepend[InputRows, {Style[\"Símbolo\", Bold], Style[\"Valor\", Bold], Style[\"Unidad\", Bold]}],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Left}, Center},
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],
  Cell["Las propiedades A_p, I_p y S_p corresponden a la fila exacta CSPI 76 x 25 de 2,80 mm de espesor especificado y 2,64 mm de espesor base de diseño. No se interpola una fila para 3,0 mm.", "Text"],

  Cell["3. Geometría y propiedades circunferenciales", "Section"],
  Cell["R = D_i/2,    EAθ = Eθ A_p,    EIθ = Eθ I_p,    η = I_p/(A_p R²),    c_p = I_p/S_p", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["RadiusM = Inputs[\"insideDiameterM\"]/2;
AreaM2PerM = Inputs[\"areaMm2PerMm\"] 10^-3;
InertiaM4PerM = Inputs[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"] 10^-9;
YoungModulusKPa = Inputs[\"youngModulusGPa\"] 10^6;
ExtensionalRigidityKNPerM = YoungModulusKPa AreaM2PerM;
FlexuralRigidityKNM2PerM = YoungModulusKPa InertiaM4PerM;
SectionRatio = InertiaM4PerM/(AreaM2PerM RadiusM^2);
FiberDistanceMm = Inputs[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"]/Inputs[\"sectionModulusMm3PerMm\"];
GeometryRows = {
  {\"R\", RadiusM, \"m\"},
  {\"EA_theta\", ExtensionalRigidityKNPerM, \"kN/m\"},
  {\"EI_theta\", FlexuralRigidityKNM2PerM, \"kN m^2/m\"},
  {\"eta\", SectionRatio, \"-\"},
  {\"c_p\", FiberDistanceMm, \"mm\"}
};
Grid[
  Prepend[
    ({#[[1]], NumberForm[N[#[[2]]], {14, 10}], #[[3]]} & /@ GeometryRows),
    {Style[\"Símbolo\", Bold], Style[\"Valor\", Bold], Style[\"Unidad\", Bold]}
  ],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Left}, Center},
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],

  Cell["4. Estado de tensiones efectivas", "Section"],
  Cell["El escenario adopta K_0 = 0,50. No se comparan aquí formulaciones alternativas de K_0.", "Text"],
  Cell["sigma'_h = K_0 sigma'_v,    p_m = Delta u + (sigma'_v + sigma'_h)/2,    Delta sigma = sigma'_v - sigma'_h", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["EffectiveVerticalStressKPa = Inputs[\"effectiveVerticalStressKPa\"];
K0 = Inputs[\"k0\"];
WaterPressureDifferenceKPa = Inputs[\"waterPressureDifferenceKPa\"];
EffectiveHorizontalStressKPa = K0 EffectiveVerticalStressKPa;
MeanPressureKPa = WaterPressureDifferenceKPa +
  (EffectiveVerticalStressKPa + EffectiveHorizontalStressKPa)/2;
StressDifferenceKPa = EffectiveVerticalStressKPa - EffectiveHorizontalStressKPa;
StressRows = {
  {\"sigma'_v\", EffectiveVerticalStressKPa, \"kPa\"},
  {\"sigma'_h\", EffectiveHorizontalStressKPa, \"kPa\"},
  {\"p_m\", MeanPressureKPa, \"kPa\"},
  {\"Delta sigma\", StressDifferenceKPa, \"kPa\"}
};
Grid[
  Prepend[StressRows, {Style[\"Símbolo\", Bold], Style[\"Valor\", Bold], Style[\"Unidad\", Bold]}],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Left}, Center},
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],

  Cell["5. Acciones perimetrales", "Section"],
  Cell["Pr(θ) = -p_m - (Delta sigma/2) cos(2θ)", "Equation"],
  Cell["Pt(α,θ) = α (Delta sigma/2) sin(2θ)", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[radialPressure, tangentialPressure];
radialPressure[theta_] := -MeanPressureKPa -
  StressDifferenceKPa/2 Cos[2 theta];
tangentialPressure[alpha_, theta_] := alpha StressDifferenceKPa/2 Sin[2 theta];
AlphaValues = Inputs[\"alphaValues\"];
ActionAnglesDeg = {0, 45, 90, 135};
ActionRows = Flatten[
  Table[
    {
      angle,
      alpha,
      radialPressure[angle Degree],
      tangentialPressure[alpha, angle Degree]
    },
    {alpha, AlphaValues},
    {angle, ActionAnglesDeg}
  ],
  1
];
Grid[
  Prepend[
    ({#[[1]], #[[2]], NumberForm[#[[3]], {9, 3}], NumberForm[#[[4]], {9, 3}]} & /@ ActionRows),
    {Style[\"theta [deg]\", Bold], Style[\"alpha\", Bold], Style[\"P_r [kPa]\", Bold], Style[\"P_t [kPa]\", Bold]}
  ],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> Center,
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],

  Cell["6. Resultantes seccionales", "Section"],
  Cell["Para los modos uniforme y n = 2 del estado prescrito, la solución cerrada es:", "Text"],
  Cell["Nθ(α,θ) = -R p_m + R Delta sigma (1 + 2α) cos(2θ)/6", "Equation"],
  Cell["Mθ(α,θ) = -R² p_m η/(1 + η) + R² Delta sigma (2 + α) cos(2θ)/12", "Equation"],
  Cell["Qθ(α,θ) = -R Delta sigma (2 + α) sin(2θ)/6", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[normalForce, bendingMoment, shearForce];
normalForce[alpha_, theta_] := -RadiusM MeanPressureKPa +
  RadiusM StressDifferenceKPa (1 + 2 alpha)/6 Cos[2 theta];
bendingMoment[alpha_, theta_] :=
  -RadiusM^2 MeanPressureKPa SectionRatio/(1 + SectionRatio) +
  RadiusM^2 StressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/12 Cos[2 theta];
shearForce[alpha_, theta_] :=
  -RadiusM StressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/6 Sin[2 theta];
AngleDegrees = Range[0, 359];
AngleRadians = AngleDegrees Degree;
ClearAll[resultantRecord];
resultantRecord[alpha_] := Module[
  {NormalValues, MomentValues, ShearValues},
  NormalValues = normalForce[alpha, #] & /@ AngleRadians;
  MomentValues = bendingMoment[alpha, #] & /@ AngleRadians;
  ShearValues = shearForce[alpha, #] & /@ AngleRadians;
  <|
    \"alpha\" -> alpha,
    \"normalMin\" -> Min[NormalValues],
    \"normalMax\" -> Max[NormalValues],
    \"momentMin\" -> Min[MomentValues],
    \"momentMax\" -> Max[MomentValues],
    \"shearAbsoluteMax\" -> Max[Abs[ShearValues]]
  |>
];
ResultantRecords = resultantRecord /@ AlphaValues;
ResultantRows = ({
  #[\"alpha\"],
  NumberForm[#[\"normalMin\"], {12, 7}],
  NumberForm[#[\"normalMax\"], {12, 7}],
  NumberForm[#[\"momentMin\"], {12, 7}],
  NumberForm[#[\"momentMax\"], {12, 7}],
  NumberForm[#[\"shearAbsoluteMax\"], {12, 7}]
} &) /@ ResultantRecords;
Column[{
  Grid[
    Prepend[
      ResultantRows,
      {Style[\"alpha\", Bold], Style[\"N_min\", Bold], Style[\"N_max\", Bold],
       Style[\"M_min\", Bold], Style[\"M_max\", Bold], Style[\"|Q|_max\", Bold]}
    ],
    Frame -> All,
    Alignment -> Center,
    Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
  ],
  Style[\"N y Q en kN/m; M en kN m/m.\", Smaller]
}]"], "Input"],

  Cell["Los diagramas siguientes presentan cada resultante en una figura independiente. Las dos curvas corresponden a α = 1 y α = 0.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ResultantStyles = {
  Directive[RGBColor[0.10, 0.35, 0.70], AbsoluteThickness[2.2]],
  Directive[RGBColor[0.80, 0.25, 0.15], AbsoluteThickness[2.2], Dashed]
};
Plot[
  Evaluate[normalForce[#, angle Degree] & /@ AlphaValues],
  {angle, 0, 360},
  Frame -> True,
  Axes -> False,
  FrameLabel -> {\"theta [deg]\", \"N_theta [kN/m]\"},
  PlotLegends -> Placed[{\"alpha = 1\", \"alpha = 0\"}, Above],
  PlotStyle -> ResultantStyles,
  PlotRange -> All,
  GridLines -> {Range[0, 360, 45], {0}},
  ImageSize -> Large
]"], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData["Plot[
  Evaluate[bendingMoment[#, angle Degree] & /@ AlphaValues],
  {angle, 0, 360},
  Frame -> True,
  Axes -> False,
  FrameLabel -> {\"theta [deg]\", \"M_theta [kN m/m]\"},
  PlotLegends -> Placed[{\"alpha = 1\", \"alpha = 0\"}, Above],
  PlotStyle -> ResultantStyles,
  PlotRange -> All,
  GridLines -> {Range[0, 360, 45], {0}},
  ImageSize -> Large
]"], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData["Plot[
  Evaluate[shearForce[#, angle Degree] & /@ AlphaValues],
  {angle, 0, 360},
  Frame -> True,
  Axes -> False,
  FrameLabel -> {\"theta [deg]\", \"Q_theta [kN/m]\"},
  PlotLegends -> Placed[{\"alpha = 1\", \"alpha = 0\"}, Above],
  PlotStyle -> ResultantStyles,
  PlotRange -> All,
  GridLines -> {Range[0, 360, 45], {0}},
  ImageSize -> Large
]"], "Input"],

  Cell["7. Demanda elástica de tensión normal circunferencial", "Section"],
  Cell["La coordenada de fibra ξ es positiva hacia el interior. Para la sección CSPI publicada se adoptan ξ_e = -c_p y ξ_i = +c_p.", "Text"],
  Cell["sigma_theta(α,θ,ξ) = Nθ(α,θ)/A_p + 1000 Mθ(α,θ) ξ/I_p    [MPa]", "Equation"],
  Cell["sigma_theta,e = Nθ/A_p - 1000 Mθ/S_p,    sigma_theta,i = Nθ/A_p + 1000 Mθ/S_p", "Equation"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[normalStress, formatAngles, stressRecord];
normalStress[alpha_, theta_, fiberCoordinateMm_] :=
  normalForce[alpha, theta]/Inputs[\"areaMm2PerMm\"] +
  1000 bendingMoment[alpha, theta] fiberCoordinateMm/Inputs[\"inertiaMm4PerMm\"];
formatAngles[angles_] := StringRiffle[(ToString[#] <> \" deg\") & /@ angles, \", \" ];
FiberCoordinates = <|
  \"exterior\" -> -FiberDistanceMm,
  \"interior\" -> FiberDistanceMm
|>;
stressRecord[alpha_, fiberName_, fiberCoordinateMm_] := Module[
  {StressValues, StressMin, StressMax, AnglesMin, AnglesMax},
  StressValues = normalStress[alpha, #, fiberCoordinateMm] & /@ AngleRadians;
  StressMin = Min[StressValues];
  StressMax = Max[StressValues];
  AnglesMin = Pick[AngleDegrees, Abs[StressValues - StressMin], x_ /; x <= 10^-8];
  AnglesMax = Pick[AngleDegrees, Abs[StressValues - StressMax], x_ /; x <= 10^-8];
  <|
    \"alpha\" -> alpha,
    \"fiber\" -> fiberName,
    \"stressMinMPa\" -> StressMin,
    \"anglesMinDeg\" -> AnglesMin,
    \"stressMaxMPa\" -> StressMax,
    \"anglesMaxDeg\" -> AnglesMax,
    \"stressAbsoluteMaxMPa\" -> Max[Abs[{StressMin, StressMax}]]
  |>
];
StressRecords = Flatten[
  Table[
    stressRecord[alpha, fiberName, FiberCoordinates[fiberName]],
    {alpha, AlphaValues},
    {fiberName, Keys[FiberCoordinates]}
  ],
  1
];
StressRows = ({
  #[\"alpha\"],
  #[\"fiber\"],
  NumberForm[#[\"stressMinMPa\"], {14, 7}],
  formatAngles[#[\"anglesMinDeg\"]],
  NumberForm[#[\"stressMaxMPa\"], {14, 7}],
  formatAngles[#[\"anglesMaxDeg\"]],
  NumberForm[#[\"stressAbsoluteMaxMPa\"], {14, 7}]
} &) /@ StressRecords;
Grid[
  Prepend[
    StressRows,
    {Style[\"alpha\", Bold], Style[\"fibra\", Bold], Style[\"sigma_min [MPa]\", Bold],
     Style[\"theta_min\", Bold], Style[\"sigma_max [MPa]\", Bold],
     Style[\"theta_max\", Bold], Style[\"|sigma|_max [MPa]\", Bold]}
  ],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> Center,
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],
  Cell["Las tensiones anteriores son demandas elásticas de la sección publicada de referencia. No representan la sección neta actual afectada por corrosión ni una comprobación resistente conforme a AASHTO.", "Text"],

  Cell["8. Resumen del escenario", "Section"],
  Cell[BoxData["GoverningStress = First[MaximalBy[StressRecords, #[\"stressAbsoluteMaxMPa\"] &]];
SummaryRows = {
  {\"sigma'_h\", EffectiveHorizontalStressKPa, \"kPa\", \"estado adoptado\"},
  {\"p_m\", MeanPressureKPa, \"kPa\", \"estado adoptado\"},
  {\"N_min\", Min[Lookup[ResultantRecords, \"normalMin\"]], \"kN/m\", \"alpha = 1; theta = 90, 270 deg\"},
  {\"N_max\", Max[Lookup[ResultantRecords, \"normalMax\"]], \"kN/m\", \"alpha = 1; theta = 0, 180 deg\"},
  {\"M_min\", Min[Lookup[ResultantRecords, \"momentMin\"]], \"kN m/m\", \"alpha = 1; theta = 90, 270 deg\"},
  {\"M_max\", Max[Lookup[ResultantRecords, \"momentMax\"]], \"kN m/m\", \"alpha = 1; theta = 0, 180 deg\"},
  {\"|Q|_max\", Max[Lookup[ResultantRecords, \"shearAbsoluteMax\"]], \"kN/m\", \"alpha = 1; theta = 45, 135, 225, 315 deg\"},
  {\"|sigma|_max\", GoverningStress[\"stressAbsoluteMaxMPa\"], \"MPa\",
   \"alpha = \" <> ToString[GoverningStress[\"alpha\"]] <> \"; fibra \" <>
    GoverningStress[\"fiber\"] <> \"; theta = \" <>
    formatAngles[GoverningStress[\"anglesMinDeg\"]]}
};
Grid[
  Prepend[
    ({#[[1]], If[NumericQ[#[[2]]], NumberForm[#[[2]], {14, 7}], #[[2]]], #[[3]], #[[4]]} & /@ SummaryRows),
    {Style[\"Magnitud\", Bold], Style[\"Valor\", Bold], Style[\"Unidad\", Bold], Style[\"Posición\", Bold]}
  ],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> {{Left, Right, Left, Left}, Center},
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"],

  Cell["9. Comprobaciones matemáticas secundarias", "Section"],
  Cell["Estas comprobaciones no alimentan las tablas anteriores. Verifican el equilibrio de la solución cerrada, el límite de presión uniforme y su reconstrucción con los modos n = 0 y n = 2.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[r, p, d, a, x, h, radialSymbolic, tangentialSymbolic,
  normalSymbolic, momentSymbolic, shearSymbolic];
radialSymbolic[x_] := -p - d/2 Cos[2 x];
tangentialSymbolic[a_, x_] := a d/2 Sin[2 x];
normalSymbolic[a_, x_] := -r p + r d (1 + 2 a)/6 Cos[2 x];
momentSymbolic[a_, x_] := -r^2 p h/(1 + h) +
  r^2 d (2 + a)/12 Cos[2 x];
shearSymbolic[a_, x_] := -r d (2 + a)/6 Sin[2 x];
EquilibriumResiduals = FullSimplify[{
  D[normalSymbolic[a, x], x] - shearSymbolic[a, x] + r tangentialSymbolic[a, x],
  D[shearSymbolic[a, x], x] + normalSymbolic[a, x] - r radialSymbolic[x],
  D[momentSymbolic[a, x], x] - r shearSymbolic[a, x]
}];
EquilibriumResiduals"], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData["UniformPressureLimit = FullSimplify[{
  normalSymbolic[a, x],
  momentSymbolic[a, x],
  shearSymbolic[a, x]
} /. {d -> 0, h -> 0}];
UniformPressureLimit"], "Input"],
  Cell[BoxData["ClearAll[normalModal, momentModal, shearModal];
normalModal[alpha_, theta_] := -RadiusM MeanPressureKPa +
  RadiusM StressDifferenceKPa (1 + 2 alpha)/6 Cos[2 theta];
momentModal[alpha_, theta_] :=
  -RadiusM^2 MeanPressureKPa SectionRatio/(1 + SectionRatio) +
  RadiusM^2 StressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/12 Cos[2 theta];
shearModal[alpha_, theta_] :=
  -RadiusM StressDifferenceKPa (2 + alpha)/6 Sin[2 theta];
ModalDifferences = Table[
  {
    alpha,
    Max[Abs[(normalForce[alpha, #] - normalModal[alpha, #]) & /@ AngleRadians]],
    Max[Abs[(bendingMoment[alpha, #] - momentModal[alpha, #]) & /@ AngleRadians]],
    Max[Abs[(shearForce[alpha, #] - shearModal[alpha, #]) & /@ AngleRadians]]
  },
  {alpha, AlphaValues}
];
Grid[
  Prepend[ModalDifferences, {\"alpha\", \"max |Delta N|\", \"max |Delta M|\", \"max |Delta Q|\"}],
  Frame -> All,
  Alignment -> Center,
  Background -> {None, {LightGray, None}}
]"], "Input"]
},
WindowTitle -> "Revestimiento circular enterrado — escenario determinístico",
WindowSize -> {1200, 900},
Magnification -> 1.0,
StyleDefinitions -> "Default.nb"
]
